,"color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-29T15:46:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T10:20:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nWin 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe travel_cost property of NavigationRegion2D appears to have no effect on 2D pathfinding behavior. When two regions with differing travel_cost values are connected and properly mapped, agents still select the shortest path by distance, not by cost.\n\nExpected behavior:\n- NavigationAgent2D should prefer regions with lower travel_cost even if the path is longer.\n\nObserved behavior:\n-Pathfinding ignores travel_cost entirely and computes shortest Euclidean path.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n-Create two NavigationRegion2Ds on the same NavigationMap.\n-Give one region travel_cost = 1.0, and the other travel_cost = 0.1.\n-Connect them physically so navigation is valid across both.\n-Place a NavigationAgent2D such that it can either:\n-Take a short direct route through the 1.0-cost region, or\n-Take a longer but cheaper route through the 0.1-cost region.\n-Observe that the agent always chooses the shortest route.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-test-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21492864/new-test-project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109087/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}